1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,871
The dashboard is one
window with six areas.

2
00:00:05,071 --> 00:00:10,157
Top right: the server, the model,
track setup, and Settings.

3
00:00:10,357 --> 00:00:15,443
Middle left: global settings
that apply to every generation.

4
00:00:15,643 --> 00:00:20,514
Middle right: one strip per
track, with its own controls.

5
00:00:20,714 --> 00:00:26,300
Bottom right: how many variations
to make, and the Generate button.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,943
Bottom left: a summary of the last
generation, and a console log.

7
00:00:34,143 --> 00:00:40,157
Your settings are saved in the project,
and come back when you reopen it.

8
00:00:40,357 --> 00:00:46,014
The server address, model and theme
are saved for the whole machine.
